    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95202" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτ-ίτας</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
		epith. of Zeus, whether as bringer of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dark</i> clouds (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελαινεφής</span>), or as a god of the nether world, or
			from the <i>dark</i> oak-forest surrounding the shrine (v.l.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκοτινᾶς</span></b>  ap.<i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				3.10.6
			</span></i>.</div>
